entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KDtGaaYZDtsQ7kNvwHLFdJI&_nc_oc=Adpgsb645X2zguhhudQkx2CS2xaz0U6a-dOW-mK17qqUh-OjvUH3MhhpOTdzkrFHz9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmzOyAnTo3pBbn71xUGYapcu0PJ0cc1ORnRENJK3YJdw&oe=6B05A0AF"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8F1xQxH0vrEQ7kNvwHyAXhy&_nc_oc=AdqB3ks53Fhh4qDS-l2AQBB1hXCVE6Z9c3xOlsvSSFz76GxXVK1IDVvs2kTFSFM0n38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT3PtIYYT7G6MpL2sYwMRMJX65PzvJHnygku7VTp5lLFg&oe=6B05BF2D"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BPa1wBofhrUQ7kNvwE0dZPH&_nc_oc=AdoawDeD3GeyBL2nUNh2vFc5Tp0esmV1sZ5v0Vxxw5qXlIQVInili2H4tJc4erDC3uA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNDHSlJrx-VBdT0NONY9LPiwzlymzkvsK2RygJb0t_EQ&oe=6B05B739"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49